&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2022/03/03-2022/03/05:&lt;/strong&gt; All testing with SCP-5217 is temporarily halted. Dr. Schrag complies with confinement and participates fully in the psychological evaluation. Aside from an inexplicable shift in her self-reported sexual and romantic orientations and a 0.3% decrease in score on the Loeffler-Perdue depression scale, Dr. Schrag demonstrates no significant psychological changes as a result of the 5217-Alpha event relative to her last psychological examination of 2021/08/12.&lt;/p&gt;
