				<description>

&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div id=&quot;wiki-tabview-b18efc96e47e1f7f69a6fd128f5039fa&quot; class=&quot;yui-navset&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;yui-nav&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;selected&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Profile&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Contributions&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Plans&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Favourites&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;yui-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;wiki-tab-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;border:solid 1px #999999; background:#F0F8FF; padding:5px; margin-bottom: 5px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hey, I&#039;m &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sirslash47&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6438262&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1607008306&quot; alt=&quot;Sirslash47&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6438262)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sirslash47&quot;  &gt;Sirslash47&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;. Often also called Sirslash or Slash.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I first came into contact with the SCP-wiki a few years ago. Most likely somewhere between 2012-2014 but perhaps even sooner. I&#039;d say somewhere in 2012 but I wouldn&#039;t bet on it. After 2014 I definitely knew what the wiki was. I kind of had an on-off thing where I remembered it and forgot it again.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I joined in May 2020 because I remembered that I could actually apply. I actually could have joined years sooner. But I&#039;m glad that I&#039;m here now. I see myself as a mediocre member of the wiki and user of the chat.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I hope I can build towards others their experience here in general. Thank you, for checking out my author page.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
