&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span&gt;Tubby&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Morphing in what it has consumed&lt;br /&gt;
It&#039;s still cuter than I assumed&lt;br /&gt;
This feline fabric grey plushy&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;em&gt;Am hungry, gimme a munchy!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Remains are regurgitated&lt;br /&gt;
Mostly organic related&lt;br /&gt;
It&#039;s jaw still ever so stretchy&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;em&gt;Am hungry, gimme a munchy!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Soul devourer, corpse consumer&lt;br /&gt;
For some biscuits, GoI defuser&lt;br /&gt;
The good ones, so crisp and crunchy&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;em&gt;Am hungry, gimme a munchy!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Inspired by: &lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-4966&quot;&gt;SCP-4966&lt;/a&gt; from &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/deadly-bread&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3988532&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1607008308&quot; alt=&quot;Deadly Bread&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3988532)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/deadly-bread&quot;  &gt;Deadly Bread&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
